.TH MYGREP 3 "2026-09-23" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
mygrep \- search for lines containing a string in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include "myfilefunctions.h"

int mygrep(FILE* fp, const char* search_str, char*** matches);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads the open stream fp line by line and stores a newly allocated copy of every line containing search_str in an array, whose address is returned in matches. The caller must free every string and the array. Returns the number of matching lines, or -1 on failure.
